      "notes": [
        "Silver Plus has tiered APYs; whether you earn the higher tier depends on the account’s Tier 2 threshold (KB mentions thresholds in some docs). With $20,000 you may or may not hit the higher tier depending on the threshold for the personal Silver Plus product.",
        "This option yields less interest than the Gold Account options above if the Gold base APY is 5.5% as documented."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Other high-bonus combos (examples from KB; require base APY or fee lookup)",
      "source_docs": [
        "doc_savings_accounts_platinum_plus_account_009",
        "doc_savings_accounts_diamond_elite_account_011"
