        "KB rule: multiple credit-card APY bonuses do NOT stack — only the single highest card bonus applies.",
        "KB rule: checking-account APY boosts also do NOT stack with each other; only the single highest checking boost applies. Your Light Blue checking is not listed as providing a boost."
      ]
